OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition begins at luxury
OL,7,     Fweight-loss and detox retreat
OL,8,     FSlimmeria in East Sussex, owned by
OL,9,     FGalia and Michael. But what will
OL,10,     Ftheir guests make of the 9pm
OL,11,     Fcurfew?
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJan and William host at their
OL,14,     Ffive-star gold-rated B&B, 38 St
OL,15,     FGiles in Norwich, where their
OL,16,     Fguests have the ride of their
OL,17,     Flives on the race track and are
OL,18,     Fblown away by breakfast.
