OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFun-loving Ann and Bill host at
OL,7,     Ftheir four-star B&B in Bude, north
OL,8,     FCornwall, with Cornish cream tea,
OL,9,     Fa local stick dance, a drink in
OL,10,     Ftheir garden shed, and 'weekday
OL,11,     Fcaviar'.
OL,12,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FDiane and Max are the last to
OL,14,     Fhost, at Ombersley Bed & Breakfast
OL,15,     Fin Worcestershire, where there's
OL,16,     Fbickering over gluten-free bread
OL,17,     Fand hand washing, and some
OL,18,     Funderwhelming eggs.
